# IBEX Harness — root build-context filter for every service image.
#
# Every Dockerfile in this repository builds from the repository root:
#   podman build -t ibex-<service>:local -f services/<service>/Dockerfile .
# so this file applies to all of them. It removes build noise, local caches,
# and secrets without excluding any path a Dockerfile copies.
#
# Copied build inputs that MUST stay visible (audited against every COPY):
#   go.mod, go.sum, package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, pnpm-workspace.yaml, .npmrc
#   packages/**          (Go builds copy the whole tree; Python builds copy
#                         authclient, apierror_py, ibex_async_db,
#                         ibex_idempotency, mcp_gateway, mcp_runtime, proto)
#   services/**/         (each Dockerfile copies its own service tree)
#   infra/provider-capabilities/**
#   infra/migrations/**
#   site/package.json, packages/proto/package.json (pnpm workspace manifests)
#
# Verified by building services/auth (Go), services/context, and
# services/console from this context.

# --- VCS metadata -----------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Agent / editor / loop scratch (not repository content) -----------------
.opencode
.claude
.cursor
.zcode
.idea
.vscode
.codacy
.codescene
.semgrep
.semgrepignore
new findings
LOOP.md
STATE.md
loop-budget.md
loop-constraints.md
loop-run-log.md
safety.md
gate.yaml
opencode.json
MODEL-POLICY.md

# --- Secrets: never send a real environment file into a build context -------
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
!**/.env.example
secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
infra/compose/v1-single-node/certs

# --- Node / pnpm ------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules
.nuxt
**/.nuxt
**/.nuxt-stale-*
.output
**/.output
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.wrangler
.wrangler
**/.cache
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/test-results

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/.eggs
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/coverage
